## 11. Component Reference (current repo, verified)

| Path | Role today | Role in this architecture |
|---|---|---|
| `scripts/bootstrap.sh` | OS detection, dependency install, initial stow | Gains `--dry-run`, idempotent `ensure_X()` structure, WSL detection (§6) |
| `scripts/stow.sh` | Applies Stow packages | Becomes the `apply` step in reconciliation |
| `scripts/validate.sh` | Syntax/config validation | Becomes the `verify` step; also the CI static/policy layer |
| `scripts/pull-updates.sh` | Fetch, rebase staging → machine branch, re-stow | Becomes the one-way sync flow (§7.1) |
| `scripts/push-changes.sh` | Auto-commit machine branch on trigger | Rescoped to explicit allow-list + secret scan (§7.2, §8) |
| `scripts/install-tools.sh` | Tool installation | Unchanged; called from `INSTALL_DEPENDENCIES` |
| `scripts/manifest-gen.sh` | Generates package manifests | Feeds `manifests/dpkg.txt`, `flatpak.txt` — unchanged |
| `manifests/*.txt` | Flat package lists | Unchanged; referenced by host profiles |
| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | PR validation | Merged into the single PR-gate workflow (§9) |
| `.github/workflows/validate.yml` | PR validation (overlapping with ci.yml) | Merged into the single PR-gate workflow (§9) |
| `.github/workflows/comprehensive.yml` | Scheduled matrix + Docker build | Unchanged role |
| `.githooks/pre-push` | Blocks direct push to `main` | Kept as advisory-only; enforcement moves server-side (§8) |

