## 12. Deferred / Out of Scope for This Architecture

- Event-driven (udev/Task Scheduler) triggers as anything more than an accelerator on top of the timer (§7.3).
- Generalizing `dotctl` into a reusable framework beyond this repo.
- A GUI or dashboard over reconciler state.

These are tracked separately in the project's PRD, not repeated here — this document is the architecture; the PRD is the rollout plan.

